 "prepText": "AURON · 2 OF 3 “Your party is ready.” The tabs are for later. Start the battle. ESC SKIP THE GUIDE PARTY PREP EXP · PENANCE — THE FAHRENHEIT — THE DECK T Tidus S.LV 180 Y Yuna S.LV 175 A Auron S.LV 180 W Wakka S.LV 165 L Lulu S.LV 170 R Rikku S.LV 160 K Kimahri S.LV 150 CHAPTER STATS SPHERE GRID EQUIPMENT ITEMS OVERDRIVE FFX · EXP Penance Keep one hand down The last of the old defenders waits above the deck, two hands at its sides that grow back whole. Strike the hands, break its stride, and never let both stand at once. the deck what hangs over the bow one hand down OBJECTIVES Make it split Bring it below half Lay it to rest TIP Nul-All Mix, Three Stars, Quick Hit. Keep a hand down each Penance turn: hold its last blow till just before it acts. Dispel its Regen and anyone Immolation breaks. START BATTLE T Tidus HP 9999/9999 · MP 999/999 WARRIOR Y Yuna HP 9999/9999 · MP 999/999 SUMMONER R Rikku HP 9999/9999 · MP 999/999 THIEF",
 "prepEsc": "party-prep",
