  "lines": [
   "EXPERIMENTAL · THE FAHRENHEIT — THE DECK Tidus GUARDIAN Okay. That is bigger than anything we have fought. AUTO ENTER ADVANCE · HOLD ENTER SKIP · ESC MENU",
