   "EXPERIMENTAL · THE FAHRENHEIT — THE DECK Lulu GUARDIAN They are part of it. They are only slower to die. AUTO ENTER ADVANCE · HOLD ENTER SKIP · ESC MENU",
   "EXPERIMENTAL · THE FAHRENHEIT — THE DECK Auron GUARDIAN Cut a hand down and it grows back. AUTO ENTER ADVANCE · HOLD ENTER SKIP · ESC MENU"
  ],
